message: "If you use or build on ECONOVA-S™, please cite this repository."
title: "ECONOVA-S: An FT50- and AJG/ABS 4*/4-Grounded Dual-Core Architecture for Governed AI Scientific Discovery in Economics and Finance — Architecture and Proof of Concept"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Homayoun"
    given-names: "Saeid"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2536-0446"
version: "2.5"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun"
abstract: >-
  ECONOVA-S is a dual-core scientific economic intelligence architecture grounded in a systematic, relevance-gated synthesis of current FT50 and AJG/ABS 4*/4 research. It separates a Stable Economic Knowledge Core from a Replaceable Technology Core and uses a supporting AI-to-AI Scientific Intelligence Fabric for governed hypothesis generation, empirical conversion, specification search, independent review, replication, falsification, welfare interpretation, Evidence Passport construction, and human approval. POC-001 demonstrates computational and governance feasibility through an executable synthetic firm-year pipeline centered on Data Capability, Green Innovation, Firm Value, and Social Data Value. The POC is demonstration evidence only: results are associational, synthetic estimates are not treated as economic findings, and discovery_claim_allowed remains false pending real-data validation, credible identification, replication, and human scientific judgment.
keywords:
